        "title": "The depot firewall blocks a vendor shell",
        "description": "Depot chargers report over the SD-WAN edge while the charger vendor tries to open a remote shell on them. The firewall's rule lets OCPP out and denies the shell: blocked on purpose, never counted as lost.",
        "seed": 51,
